	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not be visible on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for a non permissioned user
	And the customer contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not be visible on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for a non permissioned user

