Scenario: Assign customer contact to account as permissioned user
	Koroneiki customer contacts should be able to be assigned to accounts by permissioned users.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code         | KORAUTO                                  |
	| Description  | Test automotive account on koroneiki     |
	| Fax Number   | 555-555-1234                             |
	| Name         | Koroneiki Automotive                     |
	| Phone Number | 555-555-5678                             |
	| Region       | United States                            |
	| Status       | Approved                                 |
	| Tier         | Regular                                  |
	| Website      | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              |
	And I set the permissions for a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| Assign Contact | true |
	And I set the permissions for a contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| View | true |
	And I set the permissions for the "Account Customer" type contact role "Member" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| Assign Contact | true |
	And I assign customer contacts with the following email addresses to the account "Koroneiki Automotive" as a permissioned user
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	Then the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	And the customer contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive"

